  "fullDescription": "2027 Mental Health & Self Care Planner – Canva Template\n\nStay grounded, balanced, and cared for in 2027 with this beautifully designed Canva template!\nPerfect for mental health tracking, self-care routines, and daily wellness habits.\nFully customizable and easy to use — start prioritizing yourself today.\n\nWhat’s Inside:\n\n▸ Table of Contents for Easy Navigation\n▸ 2027 Calendar + Holidays\n▸ Monthly Calendar (Jan–Dec)\n▸ Weekly Planner & Monthly Planner\n▸ Daily Planner & To-Do List\n▸ How to Self Care – Mental Health Guide\n▸ Tips for Getting Better in Life\n▸ 4 Tips for Maintaining Good Mental Health\n▸ 5 Tips to Increase Happiness & Wellbeing\n▸ Self Care Intention, Checklist & Tracker\n▸ Self Love Planner, Diary, Notes & Reminder\n▸ Personal Reflection & Self-Reflection Questions\n▸ Brain Dump Page\n▸ Daily, Morning & Evening Gratitude\n▸ My Daily Gratitude Log & 30 Days of Gratitude\n▸ Gratitude – Monthly Preview & Review\n▸ Self Love Gratitude\n▸ Daily Health & Daily Wellness Log\n▸ My Daily Mental Health Tracker\n▸ Habit Tracker & Health Habit Weekly Log\n▸ Bedtime Routine & Sleep Tracker\n▸ Medication Tracker & Medical History Log\n▸ Doctor Visits Log & Emergency Contacts\n▸ Period Tracker\n▸ Meal Planner & Weekly Meal Plan\n▸ Daily Food Tracker\n▸ Yoga Planner, Routine & Journal\n▸ Yoga Class Planner\n▸ Make Your Goals SMART\n▸ Goals Planner (Monthly Breakdown)\n▸ Vision Board\n▸ Lined Notes Pages\n\n69 unique, thoughtfully designed pages to support your mental health journey all year long!\n\nWhat You’ll Receive:\n\n▸ Editable Canva Template Link\n▸ High-Quality Print-Ready PDF (69 pages)\n▸ JPG Files\n▸ US Letter Size: 8.5″ x 11″\n▸ 100% Original, Premium Interior Design\n\n💡 How to Use:\n1- Download your file after purchase\n2- Open the Canva link included in the PDF\n3- Create a copy of the template before editing\n4- Customize and reuse the template as needed\n5- Print at home, a local shop, or using an online printing service\n\n📌 This is a digital product — no physical item will be shipped.\n\n❤️ Thank you for visiting and supporting my shop!",
